```

### Case 7: Continuous Video Generation (Return Last Frame)

```json  theme={null}
{
  "model": "doubao-seedance-2.0",
  "prompt": "The kitten continues walking toward the camera",
  "image_urls": ["https://example.com/last_frame_from_prev.png"],
